  "notes": "Title states DDM and 14dB power budget. Power budget 5–14dB (w/o optical path penalties). Dispersion penalty max 2dB. Transmitter/receiver power values are average power (footnote 1). Minimum input power and overload measured @ 10.3Gbps, BER 1x10-12, PRBS 231-1, back-to-back (footnote 2). Storage temperature -40°C to +85°C. IEEE 802.3ae 10GBASE-ER/EW defined only at 1550 nm; standard cited for bridgeable distance on other DWDM wavelengths. Bit rate support stated as 0.6Gbps to 11.3Gbps; overview also cites 600 Mbps to 11.3 Gbps. Protocol support includes 1G, 2G, 4G, 8G, 10G FC and CPRI Opt 1–8, 7A and OBSAI 1x, 2x, 4x, 8x.",
